<title>USA: Chevron names ex-US Sen. Johnston to board.</title>
<headline>Chevron names ex-US Sen. Johnston to board.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chevron Corp on Monday named former U.S. Senator Bennett Johnston to its board of directors.</p>
<p>Johnston, 64, a former Democratic senator from Louisiana, served in the U.S. Senate for 24 years until his recent retirement.</p>
<p>He served as long-time member of the Senate Committee on Energy and Natural Resources, including an eight-year stint as chairman.</p>
